DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist On
 ly\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/209740\n\n5:30PM Re
 ception\, 6:00PM Ceremony\nJoin us for an inspiring evening celebrating th
 e exceptional local recipients of this year’s Youth & Education pillar g
 rants\, extended on behalf of The ‘Quin Impact Fund through member donat
 ions. This event will honor the exceptional organizations that nurture our
  community’s young minds and inspire the next generation of leaders\, le
 arners\, and creators. Interested in making an impact? Look forward to con
 necting with leaders in the space during the reception to learn more about
  their philanthropic initiative.\n\nOur esteemed grant recipients include:
 \n\n826 Boston\nAction for Boston Community Development\nBionic Project\nB
 oston CASA\nBoston Debate League\nBoys & Girls Clubs of Dorchester\nCathle
 en Stone Island Outward Bound School\nCristo Rey Boston High School\nFishe
 r College\nHopeWell\nHorizons for Homeless Children\nInquilinos Boricuas e
 n Acción\nJeanne Geiger Crisis Center\nScience Club for Girls\nSummer Sea
 rch Boston\nTeach For America Massachusetts\nThe Upward Project\nUrban Col
 lege of Boston\nYouthConnect\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved 
 for members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be serve
 d. Cancellations made within 24 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\
 , will result in a $25 charge.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/209740
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
