DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent U
 RL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/211097\n\n10:00AM Reception\, 
 10:30AM Presentation\nDiscover the world of BVLGARI\, where Italian artist
 ry\, heritage\, and distinctive design come together. Founded in Rome in 1
 884 by Greek silversmith Sotirio Bulgari\, the celebrated jewelry Maison d
 raws inspiration from the art\, architecture\, and grandeur of the Eternal
  City.\n\nJoin us at The ’Quin for an intimate exploration of the Maison
 ’s rich history\, creative vision\, and enduring dedication to craftsman
 ship. Discover a curated selection of BVLGARI creations in person\, with a
 n opportunity to appreciate the artistry and details that define its unmis
 takable style.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members on
 ly. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served. Cancellatio
 ns made within 24 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will result 
 in a $25 charge.
