UID:quin-event-211080@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20261201T160000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261201T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261201T180000
SUMMARY:Hands On Impact: Pine Street Inn
LOCATION:Offsite: Pine Street Inn
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\, The 'Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: F
 ree\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/211080\n\nJoin fellow members for a meaningful evening of service at 
 Pine Street Inn’s Men’s Inn shelter\, helping serve dinner to guests i
 n a welcoming\, restaurant-style setting. Through a shared meal and though
 tful hospitality\, volunteers help create an atmosphere where every guest 
 feels welcomed\, respected\, and cared for.\n\nThis hands-on opportunity s
 upports Pine Street Inn’s mission of helping individuals move from homel
 essness to stable housing. Come together to give your time\, connect with 
 the broader Boston community\, and contribute to an evening centered on di
 gnity\, kindness\, and the comfort of a warm meal.\n\n*This event is compl
 imentary and reserved for members only. To ensure a smooth and comfortable
  volunteer experience\, we ask that attire be both respectful and practica
 l- long pants and closed-toe shoes are required. All volunteers will need 
 to wear a hat or hairnet\; you are welcome to bring your own baseball cap\
 , or a hairnet will be provided. Volunteers with facial hair will be requi
 red to wear a beardnet to maintain a safe and polished service environment
 .
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/211080
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund,The 'Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
